<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr" data-tema="aydinlik">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>404 - Sayfa Bulunamadı · OzgurAPP</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root { --bg:#f7f5f2; --yazi:#2d2926; --yazi2:#70675f; --vurgu:#c45d3e; }
* { box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0; }
body { font-family:'Sora',sans-serif; background:var(--bg); color:var(--yazi); min-height:100vh; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; text-align:center; padding:24px; }
.kap { max-width:480px; }
.sayi { font-size:120px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-8px; color:var(--vurgu); line-height:1; opacity:0.8; }
h1 { font-size:24px; font-weight:600; margin:16px 0 12px; }
p { color:var(--yazi2); line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:32px; }
.geri-btn { display:inline-block; background:var(--vurgu); color:white; padding:14px 32px; border-radius:12px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; transition:all 0.2s; }
.geri-btn:hover { transform:translateY(-2px); box-shadow:0 6px 14px rgba(196,93,62,0.22); }
.sayac { margin-top:20px; font-size:13px; color:var(--yazi2); }
.sayac span { color:var(--vurgu); font-weight:600; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="kap">
  <div class="sayi">404</div>
  <h1>Sayfa Bulunamadı</h1>
  <p>Aradığınız sayfa mevcut değil veya taşınmış olabilir.</p>
  <a href="/" class="geri-btn">Ana Sayfaya Dön</a>
  <div class="sayac"><span id="s">10</span> saniye sonra ana sayfaya yönlendirileceksiniz.</div>
</div>
<script>
let n=10;
const el=document.getElementById('s');
setInterval(()=>{ n--; el.textContent=n; if(n<=0) location.href='/'; },1000);
const t=localStorage.getItem('tema'); if(t) document.documentElement.dataset.tema=t;
</script>
</body>
</html>
